# Alterac Mountains (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 shipped flagged rares of Alterac Mountains
# and its fixed containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the
# core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up
# never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper is
# the rare. The in-band Narillasanz ships as a normal collect rare (44 sits
# inside the 20-45 Horde band - the Alliances above-band exclusion does not
# transfer); Cranky Benj ships as a kill-note rare whose Turtle Meat feeds
# the cores 7321 bisque loop, said plainly. Alterac Valley is the separate
# key 1459, which holds zero rare-flagged spawns in the data - battleground
# content is out of the packs scope regardless. No tame lines ship (the data
# has no tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame corroboration -
# see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere,
# so none are stated. No shipped rare is a giver, ender, or objective of any
# core-contracted quest - so this round carries no overlap notes except the
# shared Benj meat, said plainly on his step.
guide butler-routes-completionist/alterac-horde-rares
title Alterac Mountains (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 20-45
zone Alterac Mountains
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords alterac, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Stone Fury - the east

  zone map 1416

  goto 64.68,44.77
  kill 2258 optional -- Stone Fury, in the east
  collect 283254 "Heart of Alterac" optional
  note Level 37 rare at its single confirmed point in the east; its sole drop is the Heart of Alterac. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Narillasanz - the south-east

  zone map 1416

  goto 73.71,65.35
  kill 2447 optional -- Narillasanz, in the south-east
  collect 282778 "Mark of the Red Flight" optional
  note Level 44 rare at its single confirmed point in the south-east, inside the 20-45 band; its sole drop is the Mark of the Red Flight. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Skhowl - the west

  zone map 1416

  goto 31.43,51.51
  kill 2452 optional -- Skhowl, in the west
  collect 3011 "Feathered Headdress" optional
  collect 6331 "Howling Blade" optional
  note Level 36 rare at its single confirmed point in the west; its sole drops are the Feathered Headdress and the Howling Blade. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step LoGrosh - the center

  zone map 1416

  loop
  goto 47.52,32.31
  goto 52.09,46.94
  kill 2453 optional -- LoGrosh, in the center
  collect 1678 "Black Ogre Kickers" optional
  collect 4810 "Boulder Pads" optional
  collect 6327 "The Pacifier" optional
  note Level 39 rare at its two confirmed points in the center; its sole drops are the Black Ogre Kickers, the Boulder Pads and The Pacifier. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Gravis Slipknot - east of center

  zone map 1416

  goto 58.20,41.91
  kill 14221 optional -- Gravis Slipknot, east of center
  collect 283255 "Syndicate Executioners Slicer" optional
  note Level 36 rare at its single confirmed point east of center; its sole drop is the Syndicate Executioners Slicer. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Araga - the south-west

  zone map 1416

  goto 30.20,72.11
  kill 14222 optional -- Araga, in the south-west
  collect 283253 "Denmothers Hide" optional
  note Level 35 rare at its single confirmed 1416 point in the south-west (it also spawns on 1424, not used); its sole drop is the Denmothers Hide. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Cranky Benj - the north

  zone map 1416

  goto 37.29,19.83
  kill 14223 optional -- Cranky Benj, in the north
  note Level 32 rare at its single confirmed point in the north; the data shows no sole drop for it. His Turtle Meat feeds the core guides 7321 bisque loop (same camp the core already routes), so there is nothing companion-exclusive to collect. No quest takes him as a subject.
  note Drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Jimmy the Bleeder - the south

  zone map 1416

  goto 58.58,69.30
  kill 14281 optional -- Jimmy the Bleeder, in the south
  collect 282713 "Bloodstained Pants" optional
  note Level 23 rare at its single confirmed 1416 point in the south (it also spawns on 1424, covered by hillsbrad-horde-rares at its 1424 point); its sole drop is the Bloodstained Pants. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

