step Spring Well - the south-east

  zone map 1416

  goto 60.90,82.70
  interact 107045 optional
  note Spring Well at a single fixed point in the south-east; its only data source anywhere, yielding 7771 Filled Red Waterskin. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Frozen Remains - the south-center

  zone map 1416

  goto 39.70,60.80
  interact 423841 optional
  note Frozen Remains at a single fixed point in the south-center; its only data source anywhere, yielding 213452 Dormant Holy Rune. Which class can use the rune is not in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

